<title>USA: U.S. rejects Kabila deadline for refugees.</title>
<headline>U.S. rejects Kabila deadline for refugees.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1997-04-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>The United States on Monday rejected a 60-day deadline given to the United Nations by Zairean rebel leader Laurent Kabila for evacuation of refugees.</p>
<p>To put such a deadline on the United Nations was &quot;unreasonable...and unacceptable,&quot; especially when Kabila and his rebel alliance had delayed cooperating with refugee evacuation efforts for weeks, State Department spokesman Nicholas Burns said.</p>
</text>
